@HE_PROJECT_NAME@ - Windows x64
========================================

Run @HE_PROJECT_EXECUTABLE_NAME@.exe from this folder. Keep Game.pak,
python311.dll, vcruntime140.dll and the D3D12 directory beside the executable.
No Visual Studio, Python installation, HEngine checkout or build directory is
required.

Minimum supported environment (DX12 is the default):
- Windows 10 1909 build 18363.1350 or newer, or Windows 11 x64.
- A DirectX 12 driver exposing Feature Level 11_0 and Shader Model 6.0.

Vulkan can be selected with `--graphics-api=vulkan`. It requires a Vulkan 1.3
graphics driver. The Vulkan loader is supplied by the installed graphics driver;
the package intentionally does not carry SDK, validation-layer, or build-machine
Vulkan DLLs. Use `--graphics-api=dx12` to select the default backend explicitly.

If startup fails, attach this log when reporting the problem:
%LOCALAPPDATA%\HEngine\Projects\@HE_PROJECT_ID@\Saved\Logs\HEngine.log

This build is not Authenticode-signed. Windows SmartScreen may therefore show
an unknown-publisher warning for a copy downloaded from the Internet. Verify
the published SHA-256 and obtain the package from a trusted project release.
